Greg Rogers (grogers@slacvx.slac.stanford.edu) wrote:
: Here are my questions:
: 
: 1) How do I zap myself with a wand (ie teleportation, invisibility)

Use '.' for the direction.  Also, '>' is down, '<' is up.

: 3) Some corpses are tainted and will kill.  How do I avoid this?

Something that accomplishes "cure sickness".  I believe there is a spell
that is by that name.  Perhaps one of the healing potions will help, I
don't remember.  In nethack 3.0, applying a unicorn horn to yourself also
does the trick.

: 5) Other than pets, is there any other way to tell if an item is cursed?

In nethack 3.0, a priest can tell if an item is cursed or blessed.  Also
identifying an item will too.  Dropping an item onto an altar I think
works as well.  I don't remember.

